# Doppler secrets for Alte' Budgeting (cloud only — no local CLI / .env)
#
# 1. In Doppler dashboard, create project: alte-budgeting
# 2. Add these secrets to configs: dev, preview, prd
# 3. Doppler → Integrations → Vercel → sync each config:
#      dev     → Vercel Development
#      preview → Vercel Preview
#      prd     → Vercel Production
#
# Required
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR_PROJECT.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
#
# Backend Supabase key (server-only; never expose to the browser)
# Prefer the new secret key from Supabase → Settings → API Keys
# (Publishable and secret API keys tab) — looks like sb_secret_...
# SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=sb_secret_...
# Legacy fallback (optional): SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=eyJ...
#
# Public site URL (invite links, Plaid webhooks)
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-app.vercel.app
#
# ── Plaid bank sync ──
# From https://dashboard.plaid.com → Team Settings → Keys
# PLAID_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id
# PLAID_SECRET=your_sandbox_or_development_secret
# PLAID_ENV=sandbox
# Encrypts stored access tokens (any long random string)
# BANK_TOKEN_ENCRYPTION_KEY=long-random-secret
# Vercel Cron → Authorization: Bearer CRON_SECRET
# CRON_SECRET=long-random-secret
#
# Sandbox test credentials in Plaid Link: user_good / pass_good

